// Ch13: a pole-barge man. No oars in Ansedra. Heresy state: afraid, not cruel (the purveyor's precedent).
title: ch13_bark_bargeman
location: ch13/ansedra
---
<<if $ch14_declared_heretics>>
    Boatman as "Pole-barge man" [afraid]: I can't carry you. Please. Walk the causeway. #line:ch13_bark_barge_001
<<else>>
    Boatman as "Pole-barge man" [neutral]: No oars here. An oar leaves a wake. Twenty years I've poled, and I still miss the sound of rowing. #line:ch13_bark_barge_002 #long
<<endif>>
===
